  "title": "WM Sets Date for Fourth Quarter and Full-Year 2025 Earnings Call",
  "summary": "HOUSTON --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Dec. 18, 2025-- WM (NYSE: WM) announced that it will release fourth quarter and full-year 2025 financial results after the close of the market on Wednesday, January 28, 2026 , and host its live audio webcast for investors on Thursday, January 29, 2026 , at 10 a.m. ET .",
